# ---- Gen-3 (Sapphire) lane ----
# ---------------------------------------------------------------- game assets
#
# Nothing derived from the cartridge is committed. Not because it is large --
# it is not -- but because this repository must not be a way to obtain the
# game. The harness POINTS AT a ROM the user already owns; it never carries
# one, and it never carries art extracted from one.
#
# Everything below is reproducible from a decomp checkout by scripts that ARE
# committed, so a fresh clone can regenerate all of it.
# The ROM itself. Supply your own; its sha1 must match the decomp's
# pret/sapphire_rev2.sha1 (89b45fb172e6b55d51fc0e61989775187f6fe63c).
pokesapphire.gba
*.gba
*.gbc
*.gb
*.sav
# Party sprites (384 PNGs) and the Torchic mark: Pokemon art lifted out of
# the decomp's graphics tree. Regenerate with
#   .venv/bin/python widget/make_sprites.py
#   .venv/bin/python widget/make_logo.py
# The widget degrades to a glyph without the mark and says so on install.
widget/poke.run/sprites/
widget/poke.run/torchic*.png
widget/poke.run/torchic*.gif
docs/logo/
docs/party-sprites.png
# Build artifacts of the decomp. The symbol map is the harness's interface to
# WRAM, and it is regenerated by `make` -- never transcribed, never shipped.
pokesapphire_rev2.map
*.map
*.sym
# ------------------------------------------------------------ machine state
#
# Savestates are whole-machine snapshots: they contain the ROM's memory, so
# they are game data too. They are also version-coupled to one mGBA build and
# one ROM sha256 (the .meta sidecar enforces it), which makes them useless to
# anyone else even setting the licensing aside.
# Per-run telemetry. Append-only, personal to one playthrough, and it would
# conflict on every merge while telling a reader nothing about the code.
metrics/
# --------------------------------------------------------------- local tools
#
# Vendored libmgba: an extracted Arch package, reproducible via
# scripts/vendor_libmgba.sh. Prefer the system package.
vendor/
*.egg-info/
.gitlab-token
agbcc/
pret/tools/agbcc/
decomp/

# Impeccable design skill, installed per-checkout by `npx impeccable install`
# (ships an engine binary); not part of the project.
.agents/skills/impeccable/
